{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04d7b2b35f93656169acf715d871aaa0f47a1aa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + my + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d47e383261aacfb0a681dfc0930539190c51f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> the quotient is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d2d6ae8dc42c453e185eb15218630a292c6e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />. \nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04d7b2b35f93656169acf715d871aaa0f47a1aa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + my + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae82ca2ccb9272f06ddd5c41e9fe992c7770be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> the quotient is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c87ffb791483f5eb7b7cfe68f44c77bbfdf728dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> and the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/a/28ad7d97786bd592f231bc11e4bba2a83b821b72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1 = R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5ff6de9306cc7b4a86c371af903473927a4220.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ - 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ \\text{an undetermined constant}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"577\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47c894968f81a5a225e7e2fec7656d4888133e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)=y^2+my+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/4973b1d15d6c94ab2a9c4b49142a2807f52c2345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)=y^2+my+2=f(y)(y-1)+R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"314\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110fa2c46d279481ce33ce9c697bff5abbca9a6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)=y^2+my+2=g(y)(y+1)+R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"312\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79ee80958fb04846e3c58d8550f2b284bf5a905b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(1)=3+m=R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a771404b5edbd90355d74f35ebe32d936c2115e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(-1)=3-m=R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e275495e7e44d279fb3e5051b3a63115e79ead5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ea1f26eedb2d601fdd27e52e6dc0e5f4b4be7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As in the other solution, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b47c894968f81a5a225e7e2fec7656d4888133e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)=y^2+my+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />. By dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054e8d768f2c8335787ac66f3c2026ae60b2ae75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"36\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f801c8fad423e95030f9d4d7a71ed5a74270b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> (through either <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polynomial_long_division&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Polynomial long division (page does not exist)\">long</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Synthetic_division\" title=\"Synthetic division\">synthetic</a> division), we get a remainder <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa1efd9fd5e108595a729d96ec4e19f41490ddc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1=m+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />. Similarly, dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054e8d768f2c8335787ac66f3c2026ae60b2ae75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"36\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f974289e02b578ca91484886e41551ed32163c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> yields the remainder <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/e/21e637ceffbdc8619fce12e83b80316f2efb6f74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2=3-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />. Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fda4492f15c5cbdc6f4cb9c7dda4c5be797730e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1=R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a8433e50c1c8e48005d1adf35fa6fe25846ea0c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+3=3-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />, which only holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e275495e7e44d279fb3e5051b3a63115e79ead5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, which corresponds to answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/2/af2b0029c8dba2791d55316fb5ea2a7afeea77d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\